{"id":20369,"author":"UHCRS_TitoSnupp","body":"\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003ebefore beginning wanted to communicate to resepignev MOD\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eHe has banned my brother for \"alleged multicuenta''\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eand I do not like it because if I am banned for using hacks does not imply that this account using my brother, and if we at last on multiple servers.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eI see it as unfair because they know I'm the one who uses it.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eWe live in the same house, we have the same wifi do you want that we use different or what?\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eI expect a quick answer please.\u003cbr\u003eThe name is TA_PapitohZeus\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; mi apelacion\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eYour minecraft\u0026nbsp;username (most recent name if changed)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eTA_TitoSnupp\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eThe reason you were temp-banned/banned\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eNo Fall\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhy you should be unbanned from the server.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eI'm a great player on that server, and I would like to play again.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eThere are some things to think about before making an appeal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWas my temp-ban or ban really false?\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eIs True\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eDo I have any evidence to show the staff if was false?\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHave I waited long enough to be un-banned?\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e1 month\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhen it comes to appealing an infraction. The only thing that helps it is the amount of time you serve that infraction.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eDo not expect to be appealed a day after you ban if you know that it wasn't a false ban. You must face the consequences.\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eRegarding second appeals:\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eEach player only gets one chance when it comes to hacking. If you have already appealed once for hacking and you end up getting banned the second time, do not expect the second appeal to go well. They will most likely be denied\u0026nbsp;automatically.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eRegarding ban evasion:\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWell, of course if you evade a ban, the second account\u0026nbsp;will be banned. If this happens, chances of appealing it will be 0.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhen evading a temp ban via an alt account, we will be banning both accounts\u0026nbsp;from the server, so don't do it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e