Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWas my temp-ban or ban really false?\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eIs True\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eDo I have any evidence to show the staff if was false?\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHave I waited long enough to be un-banned?\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e1 month\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhen it comes to appealing an infraction. The only thing that helps it is the amount of time you serve that infraction.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eDo not expect to be appealed a day after you ban if you know that it wasn't a false ban. You must face the consequences.\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eRegarding second appeals:\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eEach player only gets one chance when it comes to hacking. If you have already appealed once for hacking and you end up getting banned the second time, do not expect the second appeal to go well. They will most likely be denied\u0026nbsp;automatically.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eRegarding ban evasion:\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWell, of course if you evade a ban, the second account\u0026nbsp;will be banned. If this happens, chances of appealing it will be 0.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhen evading a temp ban via an alt account, we will be banning both accounts\u0026nbsp;from the server, so don't do it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e","created_at":1455902883,"title":"TA TitoSnupp  and a problem with a moderator","replies":[{"id":281067,"author":"resepignev","body":"Hello TA_TitoSnupp,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegarding the appeal for your ban, refer to the appeal you made 10 days ago:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/0c312bcaf\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/0c312bcaf\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/0c312bcaf\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt says that you should wait\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003e3-5 months\u003c/b\u003e until appealing again.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNow the ban evasion thing, do you have any evidence that it's your brother and not you?\u003cbr\u003eAlso why does your\u0026nbsp;IP matchs with \u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/TA_iTzWolfy\"\u003eTA_iTzWolfy\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;(Another banned user)?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards Flo/resepignev","body_tagged":"Hello TA_TitoSnupp,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegarding the appeal for your ban, refer to the appeal you made 10 days ago:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/0c312bcaf\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/0c312bcaf\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/0c312bcaf\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt says that you should wait\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003e3-5 months\u003c/b\u003e until appealing again.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNow the ban evasion thing, do you have any evidence that it's your brother and not you?\u003cbr\u003eAlso why does your\u0026nbsp;IP matchs with \u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/TA_iTzWolfy\"\u003eTA_iTzWolfy\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;(Another banned user)?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards Flo/resepignev","created_at":1455974202}]}